<title>USA: CBOT silver deliveries - Sept 11.</title>
<headline>CBOT silver deliveries - Sept 11.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delivery notices against September silver futures for September 12 (In contracts).</p>
<p>Bot-Silver 1 - 6. Oldest long - Sept 4, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivered - 1st option/c 6.</p>
<p>Received - Prudential/c 3, LFG/c 3.</p>
<p>Delivery locations - 3 at Chicago 4002.</p>
<p>Source: Chicago Board of Trade Clearing Corp.</p>
<p>H=House account. C=Customer Account.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
